Using hansen_kink_regression.R file, we obtain:

Table 2: Regression Kink Results: IMF common tones
Table C.1: Regression Kink Results: WTO common tones
Table C.2: Regression Kink Results: UN common tones
Table C.3: Regression Kink Results: WB common tones

For each global institution, "gammas" and "dx" parameters are different depending on the dataset. 
The calculation of these parameters are given in the relevant Excel file:
For IMF: DATA_results_kinkIMF.xlsx
For UN: DATA_results_kinkUN.xlsx
For WB: DATA_results_kinkWB.xlsx
For WTO: DATA_results_kinkWTO.xlsx

